---
import SectionHeader from "./SectionHeader.astro";
---

<section id="components">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHeader num="06" title="Components" sub="A small fixed set of atomic modules, kept only where they solve a concrete UI problem." />

    <div class="not-prose mb-8 rounded-xl border border-brand-ycp/30 bg-brand-ycp/5 p-6">
      <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-2">Powered by Nuxt UI</h4>
      <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">
        Mizu now extends Nuxt UI, providing a curated design token layer and theme on top of its robust component library. For common UI primitives — buttons, inputs, dialogs, cards, badges, and more — use Nuxt UI components directly (e.g. <code class="text-xs bg-surface-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">&lt;UButton&gt;</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-surface-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">&lt;UCard&gt;</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-surface-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">&lt;UDialog&gt;</code>) with Mizu's theme applied automatically. The components listed below are Mizu-specific additions that solve unique design problems not covered by Nuxt UI.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="comp-grid">
      <a href="/components/element/button" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Button</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Action trigger with variants, sizes, and loading state.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/element/badge" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Badge</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Short text to represent a status or a category.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/element/card" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Card</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Container with header, body, and footer slots.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/forms/input" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Input</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Text input field with the same height scale as buttons.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/element/avatar" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Avatar</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">User image with fallback for initials or placeholder.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/element/kbd" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Kbd</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Keyboard key indicator for shortcuts and commands.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/element/progress" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Progress</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Horizontal bar indicating task completion or loading.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/element/skeleton" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Skeleton</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Placeholder loading indicator for content areas.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/navigation/tabs" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Tabs</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Tabbed interface for switching between content panels.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/navigation/breadcrumb" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Breadcrumb</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Navigation trail showing the current page location.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/navigation/pagination" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Pagination</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Page navigation controls for browsing paginated content.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/overlay/tooltip" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Tooltip</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Short contextual message displayed on hover or focus.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/overlay/popover" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Popover</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Floating card triggered by click, with title and content.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/overlay/dropdown-menu" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">DropdownMenu</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Menu of actions triggered by a button click.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/forms/textarea" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Textarea</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Multi-line text input with the same height scale as inputs.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/forms/select" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Select</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Dropdown for choosing from a list of options.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/forms/checkbox" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Checkbox</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Toggle control for selecting one or more options.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/forms/switch" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Switch</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Toggle for enabling or disabling a setting.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/overlay/modal" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Modal</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Overlay dialog for focused tasks and confirmations.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/data/quote" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-ycp transition-colors">Quote</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Block quotation with default and accent variants.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
